OL,3,ACustomers report service outages at
OL,4,Amajor US banks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of customers at major US
OL,7,Fbanks, including JP Morgan Chase, Wells
OL,8,FFargo and Bank of America, have
OL,9,Freported trouble accessing services.
OL,11,FChase Bank - the largest banking
OL,12,Finstitution in the US - said a
OL,13,F"software bug" in its hardware systems
OL,14,Fmay have been behind the glitch and
OL,15,Fnoted the impacts may have affected
OL,16,Fother banks. It added the issue was
OL,17,F"temporary" and not "systemic" or
OL,18,F"cyber-related".
OL,20,FProblems appeared to be easing for many
OL,21,Fcustomers by early Monday evening.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
