OL,3,ACustomers report service outages at
OL,4,Amajor US banks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issue comes after a string of
OL,7,Funrelated technical problems, including
OL,8,Fa massive Microsoft outage, a network
OL,9,Ffailure that grounded all US flights,
OL,10,Fand United Airlines reporting a
OL,11,F"widespread system outage".
